<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Anglovaal plans 19.7 mln rights offer.</title>
<headline>Anglovaal plans 19.7 mln rights offer.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglovaal Industries Ltd said on Monday it planned to raise about 412.8 million rand by way of a rights offer of 19,656,386 shares of five cents each at a price of 21 rand per new share to shareholders in the ratio of 5.5 new shares for every 100 shares held.</p>
<p>The offer ends on December 6 and a further statement detailing salient dates would be published on Wednesday, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
